           <h3 class="red" style="letter-spacing:1px;">SERVICES</h3> <hr class="line-red"/>

            <div class="text_content">
                 <h4><strong>Scientific Storage Facilities</strong></h4>
                 <p>The Corporation is committed to provide scientific storage facilities with entire satisfaction to our customer/depositors through regular treatment for preservation of stored stock.</p> 

                 <h4><strong>D.E.S.S.(Door-to-Door Extension Service Scheme)</strong></h4>

                 <p>Through door to door extension service scheme Corporation provides treatment for preservation of stock stored in the godowns of cultivators/traders/institutions on nominal charges.</p> 
           
                 
                <h4><strong> Main Services</strong></h4>
                <ul>
                    <li> Complete inspection of depositors stock in our godown every 6 months.</li> 

                    <li> Every 3 months physical verification of  depositors' stock in our godown.</li>  

                    <li> Every 6 month of stock quality and quantity based on a complete inspection in our godown.</li>  
                </ul>

                 
                <h4><strong>Curative treatment </strong></h4>
                <ul>
                    <li> Premonsoon fumigation of entire stock in June month so that stock become insect free.</li> 

                    <li> After pre-monsoon fumigation, spray stock with delta malathion.</li> 

                    <li> Every 3 months regular fumigation of depositor stock.</li> 
                </ul>

                
                <h4><strong> Preflective treatment</strong></h4>
                <ul>
                    <li> Every 15 days spray stock with malathion.</li>
                </ul>

                <%--<h4><strong>Recovery-</strong></h4>--%>
                <h4><strong>Storage Charges </strong></h4>
                <ul>
                    <li> Every month stock bills are prepared online for depositors.</li>

                    <li> Every month JVS stock bill is prepared online to Consulting RM.</li>

                    <li> As soon as we get payment from the Depositor then we release it to Godown Owner.</li>   
                </ul>
           
